trategic Reserves.</p></article><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="enhancement-loathsome-dexterity" data-enhancement-tags="" data-owner-subject="model" data-enhancement-title="Loathsome Dexterity"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement · 10 pts</div><h4><button class="term-button" data-term="emperors-children-enhancement-loathsome-dexterity">Loathsome Dexterity</button></h4><p data-source-field="text">EMPEROR’S CHILDREN model only. Each time a model in the bearer’s unit makes a Normal , Advance or Fall Back move , it can move through enemy models. When doing so, it can move within Engagement Range of such models but cannot end that move within Engagement Range of them, and any Desperate Escape test is automatically passed.</p></article></div></section></div></section>
